BannerCarouselWidget(
  banners: [
    {
      "imageUrl": "[https://example.com/promo1.jpg](https://example.com/promo1.jpg)",
      "tagText": "NEW",
      "tagColor": Colors.red,
      "title": "Summer Deals",
      "subtitle": "20% off all cold drinks!"
    },
    {
      "imageUrl": "[https://example.com/promo2.jpg](https://example.com/promo2.jpg)",
      "title": "Coffee Hour",
      "subtitle": "Buy 1 Get 1 Free on all Espressos"
    }
  ],
  height: 200,
  indicatorActiveColor: Colors.deepOrange,
  autoPlayInterval: const Duration(seconds: 5),
)
banners — A list of maps containing the data for each slide. Expected keys are imageUrl, tagText, tagColor, title, and subtitle. This field is required.

indicatorActiveColor — The color of the active pagination dot; Color(0xFF6B4E3D) (default).

indicatorInactiveColor — The color of the unselected pagination dots; Color(0xFFE0E0E0) (default).

height — The fixed height of the carousel slider; 180 (default).

autoPlayInterval — The time duration between automatic slide transitions; Duration(seconds: 4) (default).